# Allowlist. The image needs pyproject.toml, uv.lock, packages/ and README.md;
# anything else in the working tree, .env included, stays out of the build
# context and so out of every image layer.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!packages/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.egg-info/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
